{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1455059-problem-with-hero-to-demi-conversion","id":1455059,"title":"Problem with hero to demi conversion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-16T18:16:01-07:00","id":1455059,"title":"Problem with hero to demi conversion","content":"I'm struggling to understand how to make a demigod character <br /> <br /> Of course the manuscript is, indeed, a manuscript and doesn't have all the details shown the best way, but:<br /> <br /> Did someone made a demigod quicksheet? Or help telling me with page related to &quot; character creation&quot;?<br /> <br /> About the divinity dice: can I spend the divinity dice avoiding to reach the tenth dice?<br /> <br /> How do I use the divinity dice?<br /> <br /> Did someone have some example of how miracles works?<br /> <br /> Sorry for all the questions, but I'm a little bit confused","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-16T23:13:34-07:00","id":1455063,"title":"","content":"About demigod character creation neall gave this in the fan discord:<br /> I'd probably ask you to follow the Hero Creation Rules and then do the following:<br /> \u2022 Add four Legendary Titles and concomitant Deeds for each level of Legend<br /> \u2022 Add one dot to a single Attribute<br /> \u2022 Add two dots to Birthrights, purchasing upgrades if necessary<br /> \u2022 Add two points to existing Skills and one new Specialty<br /> \u2022 Add four Knacks<br /> <br /> Thats all we have for now","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-17T05:44:06-07:00","id":1455072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sakii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1455059-problem-with-hero-to-demi-conversion?p=1455063#post1455063\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About demigod character creation neall gave this in the fan discord:<br /> I'd probably ask you to follow the Hero Creation Rules and then do the following:<br /> \u2022 Add four Legendary Titles and concomitant Deeds for each level of Legend<br /> \u2022 Add one dot to a single Attribute<br /> \u2022 Add two dots to Birthrights, purchasing upgrades if necessary<br /> \u2022 Add two points to existing Skills and one new Specialty<br /> \u2022 Add four Knacks<br /> <br /> Thats all we have for now</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you so much!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}